post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
pi-ext-claude-bridge needs two pieces of user configuration:

  1. ~/.pi/agent/claude-bridge.json
     { "provider": { "pathToClaudeCodeExecutable": "/usr/bin/claude" } }

  2. ~/.pi/agent/settings.json
     "extensions": ["/usr/lib/pi/packages"]

Then sign in with `claude auth login` and pick a claude-bridge/... model in pi.
EOF
}
